Understood. This clarification changes how we should position the project academically.

We are not proposing an independent four-month PhD research program. We are preparing a substantial, software-based project for your advanced Quantum Algorithms course, with the mathematical rigor expected of a doctoral-level course but a scope that is realistic for one course project.

The first milestone is supervisor approval of a professional project proposal. We should not start implementation or commit to a particular experimental design before that approval.

